BT /F2 10.00 Tf ET
BT 59.53 743.22 Td (The sections that follow describe how customer information is handled day to day.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 712.04 Td (Databases use encryption at rest with AES-256, and disk encryption for file storage is) Tj ET
