BT 59.53 618.50 Td (A privacy programme exists and GDPR compliance work is in progress, with a data) Tj ET
BT 59.53 602.91 Td (processing agreement drafted for some customers.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 571.72 Td (Point-in-time recovery is available for production databases, and backup encryption is) Tj ET
BT 59.53 556.13 Td (applied to every copy.) Tj ET
BT 59.53 524.95 Td (Reports and dashboards are generated from the stored data on request.) Tj ET
